559
00:43:29,620 --> 00:43:31,000
Okay, but this is pretty cool.

560
00:43:31,700 --> 00:43:32,860
I like it, I like it.

561
00:43:33,400 --> 00:43:33,720
Let's go.

562
00:43:38,360 --> 00:43:39,160
Oh my goodness.

563
00:43:39,760 --> 00:43:40,480
Right there.

564
00:43:41,580 --> 00:43:42,080
Thank you.

565
00:43:43,500 --> 00:43:44,200
