572
00:44:12,370 --> 00:44:13,650
Damn, that was a lot of gold.

573
00:44:14,530 --> 00:44:15,370
Holy crap.

574
00:44:20,990 --> 00:44:22,350
Holy cannoli.

575
00:44:24,410 --> 00:44:25,790
Wait, why is that here now?

576
00:44:26,830 --> 00:44:27,410
