577
00:44:29,370 --> 00:44:30,270
Oh, that's weird.

578
00:44:31,170 --> 00:44:32,470
I probably just don't remember.

579
00:44:35,030 --> 00:44:37,190
Oh, that's weird the way it digs randomly.

580
00:44:39,590 --> 00:44:42,970
I kind of like it.

581
00:44:43,750 --> 00:44:43,990
Aha.

582
00:44:45,450 --> 00:44:46,890
That's a use for the black hole.

583
