585
00:44:56,570 --> 00:44:56,990
Nice.

586
00:44:57,950 --> 00:44:58,250
Sweet.

587
00:45:01,050 --> 00:45:01,830
Saw blade.

588
00:45:04,430 --> 00:45:05,210
On bombs?

589
00:45:05,910 --> 00:45:07,370
Yeah, I don't know about that one, bro.

590
00:45:08,550 --> 00:45:12,730
I mean, I'll take it, but I don't know about that one.

591
00:45:12,790 --> 00:45:13,370
That's all I'm saying.

592
00:45:23,430 --> 00:45:24,610
Saw blades are scary.

593
00:45:32,700 --> 00:45:36,500
Wait, it feels like I'm not doing damage sometimes when I shoot this.

594
00:45:38,800 --> 00:45:40,000
