Also, I have to remember, most of these are non shuffle now.

599
00:45:59,750 --> 00:46:01,290
Oh man, the wand is not bad itself.

600
00:46:01,430 --> 00:46:02,670
This is actually a decent wand.

601
00:46:03,710 --> 00:46:05,650
96 mana charge, 380 mana max.

602
00:46:06,870 --> 00:46:08,550
That is really good.

603
00:46:13,360 --> 00:46:15,760
