604
00:46:16,640 --> 00:46:18,580
Oh wow, see that instantly killed them.

605
00:46:19,260 --> 00:46:21,380
But then sometimes they do no damage at all.

606
00:46:22,740 --> 00:46:23,420
It's a bit weird.

607
