611
00:46:56,330 --> 00:46:58,570
It's so dumb you say it out loud.

612
00:47:00,030 --> 00:47:02,610
I mean, it did take a shower, but it's not like that.

613
00:47:02,830 --> 00:47:05,210
I mean, it is, but it's also something more.

614
00:47:05,910 --> 00:47:07,670
It's like your body is healthy feeling.

615
00:47:08,510 --> 00:47:09,850
No, you had a good meal.

616
00:47:11,170 --> 00:47:11,810
It wasn't greasy.

617
00:47:12,030 --> 00:47:12,570
It was nice.

618
00:47:13,510 --> 00:47:14,850
And you feel light on your feet.

619
00:47:14,970 --> 00:47:16,050
It's just nice.

620
00:47:16,870 --> 00:47:17,550
How did I get hit?

621
