God damn it.

622
00:47:20,890 --> 00:47:24,670
Sometimes I tried so hard to dodge that I actually get hit because I tried too hard.

623
00:47:25,470 --> 00:47:26,890
Whereas I should have just stood still.

624
00:47:32,180 --> 00:47:37,220
Oh, what a combination.

625
00:47:47,710 --> 00:47:48,010
Can I not?

626
00:47:49,570 --> 00:47:53,870
I don't want to use a black hole for this, but what I do want to do is this watch.

627
00:47:55,570 --> 00:47:56,990
Oh, that would have been so sick.

628
00:48:00,430 --> 00:48:00,710
Asshole.

629
00:48:00,830 --> 00:48:01,130
