634
00:48:12,650 --> 00:48:13,350
There's no way in the air.

635
00:48:15,730 --> 00:48:17,930
No, it's not going to work.

636
00:48:19,950 --> 00:48:20,970
That would have been funny though.

637
00:48:23,980 --> 00:48:25,240
That was my one opportunity.

638
00:48:28,400 --> 00:48:30,860
I could burn... No, that's not going to help me.

639
00:48:31,520 --> 00:48:33,340
I could dig with this, but it's going to be a random dig.

640
00:48:35,080 --> 00:48:36,360
Sometimes it's... No, it's not going to work.

641
00:48:37,160 --> 00:48:37,360
Nevermind.

642
00:48:39,240 --> 00:48:39,820
Terrible idea.

643
00:48:41,920 --> 00:48:48,400
