647
00:49:11,300 --> 00:49:12,680
I should... Oh, he has a wand.

648
00:49:13,280 --> 00:49:13,400
Hold up.

649
00:49:13,780 --> 00:49:14,460
This is scary.

650
00:49:15,860 --> 00:49:17,400
Oh, dude, I can freeze him.

651
00:49:19,340 --> 00:49:22,720
Wait, did he just summon that?

652
00:49:25,730 --> 00:49:26,710
Oh, he had an egg.

653
00:49:26,870 --> 00:49:27,230
That makes sense.

654
00:49:28,550 --> 00:49:29,310
That makes a lot of sense.

655
00:49:30,570 --> 00:49:31,130
I don't want an egg.

656
00:49:33,270 --> 00:49:34,750
Weird how they're my friends now.

657
00:49:35,030 --> 00:49:35,790
Shouldn't they be his friends?

658
