Uh, sir.

659
00:49:40,650 --> 00:49:42,430
Are you allowed to throw those chemicals?

660
00:49:44,090 --> 00:49:45,690
Have you gotten the proper permissions?

661
00:49:47,770 --> 00:49:48,690
I don't think so.

662
00:49:50,310 --> 00:49:52,190
In fact, pheromone could be nice to have.

663
00:49:52,710 --> 00:49:54,350
But I have unstable teleportation.

664
00:49:54,590 --> 00:49:55,650
I kinda need to get rid of it first.

665
00:49:56,590 --> 00:49:58,430
I also have chaotic... I have the worst potions!

666
00:49:59,430 --> 00:50:01,390
I'm carrying dangerous stuff here.

667
00:50:05,790 --> 00:50:06,550
I'm gonna empty it in here.

668
00:50:07,970 --> 00:50:11,170
I'm more afraid of polymorphine than I am of, uh, teleportation.

669
00:50:12,990 --> 00:50:16,410
Although I did get teleported into a sea of lava once.

670
00:50:17,250 --> 00:50:17,650
On accident.

671
00:50:18,750 --> 00:50:19,490
Or by accident.

672
00:50:19,870 --> 00:50:20,010
Fuck!

673
00:50:20,850 --> 00:50:22,910
My mind can't make up what sounds more correct.

674
00:50:23,450 --> 00:50:25,750
On accident or by accident, you know?

675
00:50:27,250 --> 00:50:28,690
Give me pheromone.

676
00:50:30,050 --> 00:50:31,830
I need it for friendo in Heezy Base.

677
00:50:34,490 --> 00:50:35,730
I guess they're my friends now.

678
00:50:36,290 --> 00:50:37,310
And it will last forever.

679
