I think it is.

687
00:51:04,710 --> 00:51:05,350
I don't want it.

688
00:51:07,390 --> 00:51:08,390
There's wax again.

689
00:51:09,590 --> 00:51:11,250
I feel like I'm starting to see more wax.

690
00:51:12,030 --> 00:51:12,710
More than usual.

691
00:51:23,530 --> 00:51:23,770
Next.

692
00:51:27,250 --> 00:51:27,990
Oh, he's a friend.

693
00:51:35,550 --> 00:51:36,130
Not bad.

694
00:51:40,280 --> 00:51:40,940
Where to now?

695
00:51:41,580 --> 00:51:42,180
Let me check the water.

696
00:51:46,960 --> 00:51:48,340
