700
00:52:00,370 --> 00:52:01,310
That's something to keep in mind.

701
00:52:02,290 --> 00:52:04,310
So whatever I pick up in here needs to come with me.

702
00:52:07,440 --> 00:52:08,660
I'm gonna explore a bit more.

703
00:52:08,760 --> 00:52:11,220
Especially because we still have fungal caverns.

704
00:52:13,560 --> 00:52:15,560
And there could be some nice wands there.

705
00:52:17,260 --> 00:52:19,940
In fact, it's kind of a high-risk, high-reward place.

706
00:52:23,430 --> 00:52:25,830
And it's only worth doing when you have a lot of HP.

707
00:52:35,160 --> 00:52:35,540
Oh, here we go.

708
00:52:35,680 --> 00:52:36,180
What's this?

709
00:52:38,220 --> 00:52:42,540
Magic arrow with timer, spirit bolt, slithering path.

710
00:52:44,900 --> 00:52:45,580
You know what?

711
00:52:45,760 --> 00:52:48,240
I'm kind of curious to see how that will work with a black hole.

712
00:52:49,680 --> 00:52:50,920
That seems very interesting.

713
00:53:05,850 --> 00:53:06,210
Dang it.

714
00:53:09,050 --> 00:53:11,750
I could try unstable teleportation.

715
00:53:12,590 --> 00:53:14,630
To get on the other side of that wall.

716
00:53:15,250 --> 00:53:16,490
But that's a bit risky.

717
00:53:22,210 --> 00:53:22,870
Is that mine?

718
00:53:24,910 --> 00:53:26,170
I think that's my old wand.

719
00:53:27,510 --> 00:53:28,010
Whoa.

720
00:53:39,960 --> 00:53:40,460
Good.

721
00:53:41,160 --> 00:53:42,860
All right, so I only explored the right side.

722
00:53:57,860 --> 00:53:58,960
Not get too close.

723
00:53:59,840 --> 00:54:00,540
That's okay.

724
00:54:06,070 --> 00:54:10,990
I never took the spell refresh, so I could go get more black holes if I need to.

725
00:54:23,960 --> 00:54:24,860
Okay, a wand.

726
00:54:24,860 --> 00:54:27,420
Come on, be something great.

727
00:54:29,000 --> 00:54:29,760
I need the best.

728
00:54:36,030 --> 00:54:36,710
Ooh, actually.

729
00:54:37,610 --> 00:54:38,710
That's a sick wand.

730
00:54:38,830 --> 00:54:39,730
Look at the stats on that.

731
00:54:41,890 --> 00:54:42,750
I'm taking it.

732
00:54:43,710 --> 00:54:45,090
That's an even better wand.

733
