Wait, I already went that way.

734
00:55:10,620 --> 00:55:11,320
Oh no.

735
00:55:12,560 --> 00:55:13,320
How am I gonna...

736
00:55:15,760 --> 00:55:17,620
How on earth am I gonna get through here?

737
00:55:22,910 --> 00:55:24,330
I should get the spell refresh.

738
00:55:26,970 --> 00:55:28,030
I don't see any other way.

739
00:55:28,370 --> 00:55:29,370
I feel like I'm locked in.

740
00:55:34,340 --> 00:55:34,580
Yeah.

741
00:55:34,920 --> 00:55:36,180
What a chance I'm coming back here anyway.

742
00:55:36,320 --> 00:55:37,060
I'm probably gonna die, right?

743
00:55:37,260 --> 00:55:37,700
So may as well...

744
00:55:39,880 --> 00:55:40,240
Made it.

745
00:55:40,600 --> 00:55:40,760
Nice.

746
00:55:43,180 --> 00:55:44,320
And here I should be able to get through.

747
00:55:45,380 --> 00:55:48,320
Albeit with a bit of resistance.

748
00:55:54,290 --> 00:55:55,550
It's gonna be very annoying.

749
00:56:00,230 --> 00:56:02,270
Yeah, fall down, fall down, fall down.

750
00:56:08,770 --> 00:56:09,910
There we go.

751
00:56:13,140 --> 00:56:19,160
Need to angle it in a weird way, such that the luminous drill actually hits the right things here.

752
00:56:20,340 --> 00:56:20,820
See, that's good.

753
00:56:36,460 --> 00:56:37,280
Did I make it?

754
00:56:39,200 --> 00:56:40,160
Yeah, nice.

755
00:56:43,260 --> 00:56:45,240
And I shouldn't buy anything else, I don't think.

756
00:56:48,330 --> 00:56:48,650
Gimme.

757
00:56:55,760 --> 00:56:57,120
I'm really curious about that portal.

758
00:57:02,530 --> 00:57:04,050
I need to find a way to use that.

759
00:57:07,920 --> 00:57:09,740
Oh wait, that also refreshes the portal.

760
00:57:09,880 --> 00:57:12,700
Oh, so I actually have a lot of tries with that, I guess.

761
00:57:14,820 --> 00:57:16,560
I also kind of want to try just spamming it.

762
00:57:16,600 --> 00:57:20,460
Maybe you need multiples at the same time to charge up the portal or something.

763
00:57:22,180 --> 00:57:23,440
I'm gonna go through here, I think.

764
00:57:24,260 --> 00:57:24,280
Go.

765
00:57:30,220 --> 00:57:31,120
Have a nice bath.

766
00:57:39,990 --> 00:57:40,930
Was that an ear?

767
00:57:57,120 --> 00:57:58,040
And another dead end.

768
00:57:58,220 --> 00:58:01,240
But if we are smart here, we can burn it.

769
00:58:04,090 --> 00:58:05,010
Yeah, that's nice.

770
00:58:05,790 --> 00:58:09,330
And while that's happening, I'm gonna go over here and see if I can't get to that wand.

771
00:58:10,630 --> 00:58:11,830
But it's embedded in the rock.

772
00:58:13,190 --> 00:58:15,470
There's no way unless I use a portal.

773
00:58:20,960 --> 00:58:21,920
Firebolt with trigger.

774
00:58:23,380 --> 00:58:24,700
I don't think so.

775
00:58:26,080 --> 00:58:26,180
Nah.

776
00:58:28,140 --> 00:58:29,140
Not feeling that.

777
00:58:38,410 --> 00:58:40,630
And now we gain access to up here as well, that's lovely.

778
00:58:43,480 --> 00:58:44,860
Wow, that died quick.

779
00:59:12,310 --> 00:59:14,450
Oh, the fungal caverns are leaking.

780
00:59:21,290 --> 00:59:24,970
96 to Stanley Bay.

781
00:59:35,830 --> 00:59:36,450
Here we go.

782
00:59:37,870 --> 00:59:39,570
Let's see if we can't find some wands in here.

783
00:59:40,310 --> 00:59:43,270
Or some hearts, either would make me happy.

784
00:59:45,270 --> 00:59:48,970
The problem is I can't dig at all, so that's very bad.

785
00:59:51,330 --> 00:59:55,310
Also, they're being pushed around a lot because of the puff of air I have.

786
00:59:56,130 --> 00:59:58,010
Actually really effective against melee people.

787
01:00:00,250 --> 01:00:01,330
But also a little chaotic.

788
