Because you can't keep them where you want them to be.

789
01:00:08,470 --> 01:00:11,470
Those guys are going to be annoying, as always.

790
01:00:12,750 --> 01:00:13,550
There's a wand up there.

791
01:00:14,130 --> 01:00:15,790
I have one black hole left.

792
01:00:23,990 --> 01:00:24,490
I see a mage.

793
01:00:26,050 --> 01:00:27,270
What kind of a mage is that?

794
01:00:30,650 --> 01:00:32,470
Kind of just want to observe him and see what he does.

795
01:01:00,430 --> 01:01:01,130
Are you down here?

796
01:01:09,730 --> 01:01:10,090
Uh-oh.

797
01:01:11,970 --> 01:01:13,850
That's actually good for me right now.

798
01:01:22,790 --> 01:01:23,490
Not bad.

799
01:01:25,710 --> 01:01:26,010
Uh-oh.

800
01:01:27,590 --> 01:01:28,530
There's enemies everywhere.

801
01:01:28,670 --> 01:01:29,710
This is just so scary.

802
01:01:30,650 --> 01:01:31,890
Did he just make a way through here?

803
01:01:34,710 --> 01:01:35,210
My dude!

804
01:01:35,770 --> 01:01:36,430
Thank you!

805
01:01:39,130 --> 01:01:39,950
What do we got?

806
01:01:42,630 --> 01:01:43,050
Energy orbs.

807
01:01:44,130 --> 01:01:44,690
That's big.

808
01:01:47,110 --> 01:01:48,030
But the wand is shitty.

809
01:01:51,040 --> 01:01:53,080
Oh man, I can't replace this wand.

810
01:01:53,140 --> 01:01:53,920
This wand is too good.

811
01:01:57,400 --> 01:01:58,340
At least for now.

812
01:01:58,460 --> 01:01:59,360
Let's see what else we got in here.

813
01:02:00,300 --> 01:02:01,060
I could get high.

814
01:02:02,320 --> 01:02:03,100
That's a risk.

815
01:02:06,590 --> 01:02:07,030
No.

816
01:02:09,250 --> 01:02:10,390
There's actually wands everywhere.

817
01:02:10,390 --> 01:02:13,890
In fact, in every fungal place, there seems to be a lot of wands.

818
01:02:16,390 --> 01:02:16,790
Ambrosia.

819
01:02:17,910 --> 01:02:19,290
Let's get rid of... come on.

820
01:02:19,650 --> 01:02:20,750
